# OpenSSL configuration for Garage's embedded Python.
#
# Deliberately empty. GaragePythonRuntime exports OPENSSL_CONF pointing here before the interpreter
# starts, so every OpenSSL in the process (the bundled _ssl, and the copy statically linked into
# cryptography, whose compiled-in default is Homebrew's openssl@3 folder) reads this file instead
# of a configuration found outside the bundle. OpenSSL's built-in defaults apply.
